PT-4 incident evidence (QA-4) -- real logs/commands captured during this benchmark session.
See RESULTS.md section 3 for the narrative. All content below is copy-pasted from actual
`docker logs` / `docker ps` / `docker stats` / `df` output during this session, not paraphrased.

