=====================================================================

$ docker exec fabric-tools-net sh -c "... peer lifecycle chaincode install /cc/employeeprofilerecord.tar.gz"
Installed remotely: response:<status:200 payload:"\nZemployeeprofilerecord_1.0:d7fee017895dc11995d1886e622224e6e744d606f25350cf523eee35e7b5f23b\022\031employeeprofilerecord_1.0" >
