$ docker exec fabric-tools-net sh -c "... CORE_PEER_ADDRESS=peer0.org1:7051 ... peer lifecycle chaincode queryinstalled"
Installed chaincodes on peer:
Package ID: employeeprofilerecord_1.0:d7fee017895dc11995d1886e622224e6e744d606f25350cf523eee35e7b5f23b, Label: employeeprofilerecord_1.0

(Identical package ID on both peers -- confirms the existing employeeprofilerecord-ccaas
container, bound to that package ID, is capable of serving both channels.)

=====================================================================
3. approveformyorg for Org1MSP on tenant-tenant02 -- the trigger
=====================================================================

$ docker exec fabric-tools-net sh -c "... CORE_PEER_ADDRESS=peer0.org1:7051 ... peer lifecycle chaincode approveformyorg \
    -o orderer0.org1:7050 --tls --clientauth ... \
    --channelID tenant-tenant02 --name employeeprofilerecord --version 1.0 \
    --package-id employeeprofilerecord_1.0:d7fee017895dc11995d1886e622224e6e744d606f25350cf523eee35e7b5f23b \
    --sequence 1 --signature-policy \"AND('Org1MSP.peer','OrgClient-tenant02MSP.peer')\""

Error: error receiving from deliver filtered at peer0.org1:7051: rpc error: code = Unavailable desc = error reading from server: EOF

(The approve transaction itself was broadcast to and ordered successfully -- orderer0.org1's log
confirms block [1] was cut for channel=tenant-tenant02 -- but the --waitForEvent listener failed
because peer0.org1 crashed while trying to process/commit that very block. See below.)

$ docker exec fabric-tools-net sh -c "... CORE_PEER_ADDRESS=peer0.tenant02:7051 ... peer lifecycle chaincode approveformyorg ..."
Error: failed to retrieve endorser client for approveformyorg: endorser client failed to connect
to peer0.tenant02:7051: failed to create new connection: connection error: desc = "transport:
error while dialing: dial tcp 172.21.0.11:7051: connect: connection refused"

(peer0.tenant02 was already down by the time this second command ran -- it crashed first,
independently receiving the same bad block via gossip.)

