=====================================================================
5. The panic itself -- IDENTICAL on all four affected peers
   (peer0.org1, peer1.org1, peer0.org3, peer0.tenant02)
=====================================================================

[gossip.state] commitBlock -> Got error while committing(unexpected Previous block hash.
Expected PreviousHash = [f6da9cd13eead4f06d6f936dd7d393a94b4e9997efbb068e9e61352eb6757da3],
PreviousHash referred in the latest block=
[e0240ef9b9a77a718dfc5a2290ca350327f52867700cd814113a02eb9b2ed059]
...
panic: Cannot commit block to the ledger due to unexpected Previous block hash.
Expected PreviousHash = [f6da9cd13eead4f06d6f936dd7d393a94b4e9997efbb068e9e61352eb6757da3],
PreviousHash referred in the latest block=
[e0240ef9b9a77a718dfc5a2290ca350327f52867700cd814113a02eb9b2ed059]
	github.com/hyperledger/fabric/common/ledger/blkstorage.(*blockfileMgr).addBlock
	github.com/hyperledger/fabric/common/ledger/blkstorage.(*BlockStore).AddBlock
	github.com/hyperledger/fabric/core/ledger/kvledger.(*kvLedger).commitToPvtAndBlockStore
	github.com/hyperledger/fabric/core/ledger/kvledger.(*kvLedger).commit
	github.com/hyperledger/fabric/core/ledger/kvledger.(*kvLedger).CommitLegacy
	github.com/hyperledger/fabric/core/committer.(*LedgerCommitter).CommitLegacy
	github.com/hyperledger/fabric/gossip/privdata.(*coordinator).StoreBlock
	github.com/hyperledger/fabric/gossip/state.(*GossipStateProviderImpl).commitBlock
	github.com/hyperledger/fabric/gossip/state.(*GossipStateProviderImpl).deliverPayloads

Interpretation: these peers' locally-stored block 0 (genesis) for tenant-tenant02 hashes to
f6da9cd1... The incoming block 1 (freshly cut by the orderer in response to the Org1 approval
tx) declares its own PreviousHash field as e0240ef9... -- i.e. the orderer's actual chain for
this channel does NOT descend from the genesis these peers joined with. A genuine, pre-existing
genesis/ledger fork on the previously-dormant tenant-tenant02 channel, first exposed the moment
any real block flow was triggered against it.

