$ docker inspect peer0.org1 --format '{{.HostConfig.RestartPolicy.Name}}'
no

(Restart policy is "no" -- these containers are not auto-crash-looping burning CPU right now;
they are sitting Exited, which was left as-is deliberately rather than repeatedly restarting
them to "try again" -- see RESULTS.md 3.3 for why no further repair was attempted.)

